Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 07:56:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat(agent): knowledge-starved switch (E2EKG_STARVE)

With E2EKG_STARVE naming the knowledge factory's removal.yaml, prompt()
deletes each listed match text from the named prompts/<name>.md, so the
commander, the specialists, the fast path and the raw-only arm all read
the same starved prompts. Every item is checked against its file on each
call: a match that is not found, or a file that is not a prompt, raises.
Aliases reach the agent only as catalog data through the Resolver, never
as hint text, so prompt text is all the switch removes. Unset, prompts
are byte-identical to the files.
